WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.351
mcp-tui is a terminal client for testing Model Context Protocol servers.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.447
Point it at a server and it lists the tools.

00:00:07.447 --> 00:00:10.669
Open one, and the form comes from its input schema.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.452
Run it, and the result shows beside the form.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:27.678
The CLI button gives you the same call as a shell command, ready for a script.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.793
When a server won't connect, mcp-tui says why.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.611
This server prints a banner to standard out, which breaks the stdio transport.

00:00:40.611 --> 00:00:42.582
mcp-tui quotes the line.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.543
This one never answers server discover.

00:00:50.543 --> 00:00:53.584
The error names the causes and the flag for each.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:09.716
For CI, conform runs every protocol scenario and writes a JUnit report.

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:31.404
Install it with go install or npm.

